130: 0.5606 ± 0.0076 (exact=0.5621)
131: 0.5665 ± 0.0074 (exact=0.5718)
99: 0.5696 ± 0.0072 (exact=0.5703)
52: 0.5802 ± 0.0077 (exact=0.5760)
205: 0.5808 ± 0.0067 (exact=0.5808)
121: 0.5862 ± 0.0071 (exact=0.5863)

